wqc modern Fortran translation

This distribution translates the computational routines of wqc 0.1.2 by
Anoop S Kumar to modern Fortran and FPM. Plotting code and the R/lattice/grid
visualization layer are intentionally omitted.

Upstream wqc license: GPL-3.
Copyright (C) 2025 Anoop S Kumar.

Bundled FPM path dependencies:

1. QCSIS modern Fortran translation, based on QCSIS 0.1 by Xuejun Ma,
   Jingxiao Zhang, and Jingke Zhou. License: GPL-2. See
   dependencies/qcsis/LICENSE and dependencies/qcsis/NOTICE.

2. waveslim modern Fortran translation, based on waveslim by Brandon
   Whitcher. License: BSD-3-Clause. See dependencies/waveslim/LICENSE.

The dependencies are retained as separate packages and preserve their own
license notices. The top-level wqc translation is distributed under GPL-3.

License compatibility note: upstream wqc declares GPL-3 while importing the
GPL-2 QCSIS package. This port mirrors that dependency relationship and
keeps the source packages separate. Redistribution of a linked binary
containing both components may require a separate license review.
